    "updated_at": "2017-04-30T08:45:31Z",
    "body": "The problem is that the referenced algorithm (\"process a navigate response\") takes a parameter named \"type\", but also introduces a variable named \"type\" in its steps. One of them needs to be renamed. I think it might be best to rename the parameter to \"navigationType\" as that is how callers of that algorithm name it. The parameter needs to be renamed and it also needs to be renamed in step 1 of the algorithm.",
